        "author": "elin",
        "became": "adult",
        "content": "When a traveler or stranger arrives via the east road and lodges at the inn, mention it to whoever is near you. Rumors of storytellers or outsiders often carry news of the wider world. [!warn(target=nearby, topic=stranger arrived via east road at the inn)]"
