        "content": "It is night and the village gathers at the well. Go to the well and listen to what is being shared. If you hear news of a child's birth or a family matter, note it and pass it along to the parents or elders involved. [!go(to=well)] [!talk(target=nearby, topic=child birth and family news)]"
